---
description: Start from the codebase memory and keep it accurate
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `.cursor/memory/intent.md` (product rules) and
`.cursor/memory/codebase.md` (generated map of routes, files, exports)
before searching the tree. `AGENTS.md` has commands and known dead ends.

Update `intent.md` when behavior changes. Never hand-edit
`codebase.md` — `npm run memory:update` regenerates it and the
pre-commit hook stages it. `npm run verify` fails on a stale snapshot.
